# 🚀 Starting Journey – HTML Tables Project

## 📌 Overview

This project represents the very beginning of my web development journey.

It is a simple static webpage built entirely using HTML Tables to structure the layout and organize content.  
The goal of this project was to understand how HTML works and how web pages are built from scratch.

🔗 Live Demo:  
https://abdelrahmangalal200101-cpu.github.io/Starting-Journey-Html-Tables/

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- HTML5  
- Table elements (table, thead, tbody, tr, td, th)

---

## 🎯 What I Learned

- Writing clean and structured HTML  
- Understanding how table elements function  
- Organizing content without CSS  
- Deploying a project using GitHub Pages  

---

## 📈 Progress Note

This project marks the starting point of my development journey.

From building simple HTML pages using tables to developing full React applications with APIs and authentication systems, this project reflects the foundation of my growth as a developer.

Every expert was once a beginner — this was my first step 🚀
